stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> draft: isms new · 0.1.0
    draft --> in_review: pull request opened
    in_review --> draft: changes requested
    in_review --> approved: approver review + merge · 1.0.0
    approved --> approved: new version via PR<br/>MAJOR · MINOR · PATCH + CHANGELOG
    approved --> retired: superseded_by set · RETIRED watermark
    retired --> [*]

    state approved {
        [*] --> effective
        effective --> review_due: next_review − 60 days → issue
        review_due --> effective: periodic review · PATCH or change
    }
